            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided are a transmission indication method and apparatus. Said method is applied to a base station, and comprises: determining the transmission of one or more TBs on a first number of specified time units, the first number being an integer greater than 1; generating first downlink control information (DCI) signaling, the first DCI signaling being used for indicating the transmission of the TBs in each of the specified time units; and sending the first DCI signaling to a terminal, so that the terminal transmits the TBs in each of the specified time units according to the first DCI signaling. Therefore, the disclosure indicates, by means of DCI, the transmission of TBs in different time units by using different beam directions, and also improves the communication robustness.</p>
            </abstract>
